  description: '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters

    If this card is Synchro Summoned:
    You can equip 1 Link Monster from your GY to this card, and if you do, place
    Borrel Counters on this card equal to that Link Monster''s Link Rating. This
    card gains ATK equal to half the ATK of the monster equipped to it by its effect.
    When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can remove
    1 Borrel Counter from this card; negate the activation. You can only use this
    effect of "Borreload Savage Dragon" once per turn.'
